commits.message:
test(tui): move showcase to a cfg(test) fixture, drop showcase command

demo TUI now lives in tests/inline/ and never compiles into the binary;
run it with `cargo test showcase -- --ignored --nocapture`.

feat(tui): add status tab with claude incident feed

polls status.claude.com api/v2 every 5 min on a background thread;
disk cache keeps the tab populated offline.

feat(tui): add per-account model overrides to setup tab

each account sets a default model / per-tier defaults / subagent model;
written into its runtime settings.json and cleared deterministically on switch.

feat(usage): order z.ai limit bars shortest window first

sort limits by decoded window length (5h → 7d → 30d) before building bars;
undecodable windows sort last, stable within a tier.

fix(tui): honest empty states for credential-less profiles

usage tab and banner stop claiming loading/spent without evidence;
an empty capture is refused up front (#1, #2)

feat(ui): more visible orange pulse, match gauge to overview

pulse blends toward accent_2_color directly for visible orange;
drop now-unused accent_2_pale_color helper. GAUGE_BAR_FULL 8→10.

fix(mcp): run switch off the async worker

switch_profile_noninteractive can block on the macOS keychain deadline;
spawn_blocking keeps a slow keychain from stalling the async runtime.

fix(overview): drop ·token type-column tag for long-lived tokens

the tag was the only display-only mode indicator on the overview row;
the danger ⊘ marker and the setup detail token row still surface token state
